<title>USA: London silver fixes easier, steady at 522.75 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier, steady at 522.75 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 522.75 cents vs 525.00 cents previously. Quiet, limited interest. Seen continuing consolidation in 510-540 cent wide range.</p>
<p>GOLD - Little changed after early short covering and profittaking. $352.40/$352.90, up $1.25.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady at unchanged $382.00/$383.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also steady despite $3.50 fall to $154.00/$155.00.</p>
</text>
